WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.056
Open Runtime Extensions (/extensions) to inspect shipped OCR defaults, then upload a Unicode regional plate-rules.json override.

2
00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:09.673
Switch to Offline Maps (.pmtiles), name the layer Regional Port Corridor, and upload a PMTiles v3 regional archive.

3
00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:15.686
Review Spectroscopy and Trusted CA tabs, then open Map (/map) to verify Offline: Regional Port Corridor with live portal lane markers.

4
00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:20.652
Return to Runtime Extensions (/extensions) and click Reset to Shipped Default to restore OSCAR's built-in configuration.
